  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/1a84c4f67ad74849a2deb800800fb6e3bf75e85b43a7983438cd9da2c70f5858.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(-5) of (-45) ÷ (-15) - (-3) + 5 × 1/15\n\n⇒ 225 ÷ (-15) - (-3) + 5 × 1/15\n\n⇒ -15 + 3 + 5 × 1/15\n\n⇒ -15 + 3 + 1/3\n\n⇒ -12 + 1/3\n\n⇒ -35/3\n\n**∴ The correct answer is -11(2)/(3)**",
